  "item.spelunkers_charm.spelunkers_guide": "Spelunker's Guide",
  "advancement.spelunkers_charm.obtain_guide": "The Charm of the Deep",
  "advancement.spelunkers_charm.obtain_guide.desc": "Obtain a Spelunker's Guide Book",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.page": "%s / %s",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.jei.open": "Click to open the recipe in JEI",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.jei.missing": "Install JEI to open recipes",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.chapter.start": "Start",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.chapter.lifts": "Lifts",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.chapter.carts": "Rails and carts",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.chapter.blocks": "Utility blocks",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.chapter.tremors": "Tremors",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.intro.title": "Spelunker's Guide",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.intro.caption": "A handbook for the deep",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.intro.body": "Use the colored tabs to find lifts, carts, utility blocks and tremors.\n\nTurn pages with the arrows or mouse wheel. Select a pinned item to see its recipe in JEI.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.lift_build.title": "Build a shaft",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.lift_build.caption": "Guides, then platform",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.lift_build.body": "Build guide columns as shown on the next pages. Face the toothed sides toward the platform and keep its path clear.\n\nUse the lift item on a guide or the center floor block. Each shaft takes one platform.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.lift_small.title": "Small lift",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.lift_small.caption": "3 Ă— 3 deck â€˘ 2 columns",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.lift_small.body": "Place one guide column at the center of each opposite side. Face the teeth toward the lift.\n\nAscent needs at least 1 powered motor guide per row. All guide columns must continue along the route.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.lift_medium.title": "Medium lift",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.lift_medium.caption": "5 Ă— 5 deck â€˘ 4 columns",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.lift_medium.body": "Use two opposite sides. On each, place a guide one block to either side of the middle.\n\nPower at least 2 of the 4 guide positions on each row for ascent.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.lift_large.title": "Large lift",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.lift_large.caption": "7 Ă— 7 deck â€˘ 8 columns",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.lift_large.body": "Use all four sides. Place two guides per side, two blocks away from its middle in opposite directions.\n\nAscent needs at least 4 powered motor guides per row.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.lift_controls.title": "Lift controls",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.lift_controls.caption": "Up, down and pause",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.lift_controls.body": "Right-click the lift to start or pause. Sneak-right-click to change direction.\n\nAscent needs powered motor guides. For descent, a complete guide row and a clear path are enough.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.track_basic.title": "Basic lift guide",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.track_basic.caption": "Passive guide",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.track_basic.body": "The basic guide keeps the shaft complete. Turn its toothed face toward the platform.\n\nUse it wherever a motor, stop or detector is unnecessary.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.track_motor.title": "Powered lift guide",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.track_motor.caption": "Redstone drives ascent",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.track_motor.body": "Feed motor guides with redstone. Power travels through connected motor guides above and below.\n\nAt least half of the guide positions on each travel row must have a powered motor for ascent.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.track_direction.title": "Directional guide",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.track_direction.caption": "Stop with a departure arrow",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.track_direction.body": "One directional guide makes a complete row a stop. Right-click the guide with an empty hand to flip its arrow.\n\nA fresh redstone pulse sends a waiting lift in the arrow's direction.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.track_detector.title": "Detector lift guide",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.track_detector.caption": "Signal while a lift is present",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.track_detector.body": "The detector outputs redstone strength 15 while the lift passes it or waits next to it.\n\nUse it to light a floor indicator or trigger a circuit.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_coupling.title": "Cart Coupling Hook",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_coupling.caption": "Before and after coupling",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_coupling.body": "Use the hook on two carts to link them. Repeat to unlink. One engine per train.\n\nLand on rails safely. A drop over 6 blocks onto ground breaks carts and hurts riders.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_block.title": "Block cargo",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_block.caption": "A block carried in a cart",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_block.body": "Sneak-right-click an empty cart with a block. You can add more of the same block.\n\nRight-click with an empty hand to take up to one stack. The gold label shows the quantity.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_crossing.title": "Rail crossing",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_crossing.caption": "Both tracks continue straight",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_crossing.body": "Face across a flat straight rail and right-click it while holding another rail.\n\nA crossing lets carts travel straight along either track.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_wooden.title": "Wooden rail",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_wooden.caption": "A slower stretch of track",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_wooden.body": "Wooden rails add no speed. Ordinary rails add 1 block/s; powered rails add 2. Downhill adds 0.5.\n\nLocomotives can break wooden rails.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_ejector.title": "Ejector rail",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_ejector.caption": "Redstone dismounts the rider",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_ejector.body": "Power an ejector rail with redstone to dismount a rider as the cart passes.\n\nPlace a slime block underneath to launch the rider upward.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_engine.title": "Locomotive",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_engine.caption": "A blast furnace pulls the train",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_engine.body": "Use 1, 2 or 3 fireboxes for 5, 6 or 7 blocks/s. Lock flames to pause them.\n\nShift + right-click cycles forward, stop and reverse. Rails add up to 2 blocks/s.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_jukebox.title": "Jukebox cart",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_jukebox.caption": "Music on the rails",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.cart_jukebox.body": "Sneak-right-click an empty cart with a jukebox to mount it. Use a music disc on it to play the song.\n\nRight-click again with an empty hand to take the disc out.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.block_loader.title": "Cart Loader",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.block_loader.caption": "One or two blocks above the rail",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.block_loader.body": "Set it 1â€“2 blocks above the rail and feed its slot by hand or hopper. One redstone pulse attempts one load.\n\nA comparator reads the slot. The loader can mount a Tank, which you fill with buckets.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.block_crate.title": "Mine Crate",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.block_crate.caption": "Up to 2,048 matching items",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.block_crate.body": "Right-click with items to insert them, or empty-handed to take a stack. Aim at the crate to see its count.\n\nSneak-right-click an empty cart to mount it. The loader can refill the mounted crate.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.block_tank.title": "Tank",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.block_tank.caption": "Eight buckets of one fluid",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.block_tank.body": "Right-click with a bucket to pour or draw fluid. Sneak-right-click an empty cart to mount the tank.\n\nSneak-right-click the cart empty-handed to keep the fluid. A broken tank drops empty.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.block_blaster.title": "Blaster",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.block_blaster.caption": "A redstone-powered nozzle",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.block_blaster.body": "Right-click the Blaster and insert a bucket of water, lava or powder snow.\n\nPower it with redstone to fire a jet from its nozzle.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.tremor_natural.title": "Natural tremors",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.tremor_natural.caption": "Rumbling in deep caves",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.tremor_natural.body": "Natural tremors can start in the Overworld. Deeper caves have a higher chance of stronger shaking.\n\nListen for the warning rumble. The server settings control how often tremors occur.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.tremor_explosion.title": "Explosion tremors",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.tremor_explosion.caption": "A blast can shake the cave",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.tremor_explosion.body": "Explosions below the configured height in the Overworld can cause tremors. The default cutoff is Y 32.\n\nStronger explosions can produce longer shaking.",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.tremor_falling.title": "Falling hazards",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.tremor_falling.caption": "Watch the ceiling",
  "guide.spelunkers_charm.tremor_falling.body": "Shaking can dislodge rocks, pointed dripstone and loose blocks. It can also set off geysers.\n\nMove away from unstable ceilings until the shaking passes.",
